---
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-image">
      <div class="image-placeholder">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect width="200" height="200" fill="#1a2b5c"/>
          <path d="M40 120 L100 70 L160 120 L160 170 L40 170 Z" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.95"/>
          <path d="M55 120 L100 82 L145 120" fill="#4fb6c4"/>
          <rect x="85" y="140" width="30" height="30" fill="#1a2b5c"/>
          <rect x="60" y="135" width="15" height="15" fill="#1a2b5c"/>
          <rect x="125" y="135" width="15" height="15" fill="#1a2b5c"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="image-caption">Replace with project photo</span>
      </div>

      <div class="floating-stat">
        <span class="stat-number">15+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Years Building Trust<br/>Across New Jersey</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">About JustMel LLC</span>
      <h2>A General Contractor Homeowners Actually Recommend.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        JustMel LLC was founded with one goal: deliver honest, high-quality
        exterior work that homeowners in Kearny and throughout northern New Jersey
        can count on. We show up on time, do what we said we'd do, and stand
        behind every job.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every project — from a single gutter repair to a full roof and siding
        replacement — is handled by our own crew. No subcontracting. No surprises.
        Just straightforward pricing, clean job sites, and workmanship that
        passes inspection the first time.
      </p>

      <ul class="about-features">
        <li>
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Fully Licensed &amp; Insured</h4>
            <p>NJ Home Improvement Contractor License #13VH10743600. General liability insurance on every crew.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Local to Kearny, NJ</h4>
            <p>Proudly serving Hudson, Essex, and Bergen counties. We live where we work and it shows.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>Free, No-Pressure Estimates</h4>
            <p>We walk the property, listen to what you need, and give you a clear written quote — no sales pressure.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-image {
    position: relative;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--gray-100);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .image-placeholder svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .image-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--gray-600);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .floating-stat {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1.5rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    background: var(--teal);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 220px;
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }

  .about-content .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--gray-800);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-content > p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-features li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--off-white);
    color: var(--teal-dark);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feature-icon svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .about-features h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--navy-deep);
  }

  .about-features p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .about-image {
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .floating-stat {
      right: 1rem;
      bottom: -1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
